  "evidence": "- TEXT_D: NHS and social care funding via a 1p income tax rise; mental health waiting-time standards and 24/7 crisis care; fix Universal Credit including scrapping the two-child limit and benefit cap; build 300,000 homes with 100,000 social and end rough sleeping; welcome refugees and 10,000 unaccompanied children; Clean Air Act and net zero by 2045; equality reforms (GRA reform, BSL Act); affirm UK unity and peace in Northern Ireland; maintain NATO membership and a minimum nuclear deterrent while pursuing multilateral disarmament; federal UK and stronger devolution.\n- TEXT_G: NHS Protection Act and end austerity; scrap the two-child cap and halt Universal Credit with uprating of benefits; protect the triple lock and support WASPI women; real Living Wage, ban exploitative zero-hours and close the gender pay gap; expand refugee resettlement and defend ECHR/HRA; net zero by 2045 with a just transition; seek a 2020 independence referendum via Section 30; scrap Trident; devolve immigration with a Scottish Visa; abolish the House of Lords and replace FPTP with STV.",
